 "notes": "38 provinces incl. the 4 created in 2022 (Papua Selatan ID-PS, Papua Tengah ID-PT, Papua Pegunungan ID-PE, Papua Barat Daya ID-PD; ISO 2023). The 7 ISO geographical units (ID-JW, KA, ML, NU, PP, SL, SM) are not used in addresses. ISO corrected the ID-PE spelling to \"Papua Pegunungan\" in 2026 (seen in ISO data between 2026-05-07 and 2026-08-26); iso-codes still has \"Papua Pengunungan\". ID-JK is written \"DKI Jakarta\" as in addresses (ISO name: \"Jakarta Raya\")."
